        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">Account_Advanced_Checks</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>CheckTitle__c</field>
        <value
      xsi:type="xsd:string"
    >All Open Opportunities Have a Positive Amount</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>CheckDescription__c</field>
        <value
      xsi:type="xsd:string"
    >Every open opportunity must have an Amount above zero. How To Interpret Query Results = AllRowsPass, and Expected Value Comes From = FixedValue. If Query Finds No Records = Skip, so an account with no open opportunities is skipped instead of passing for</value>
    </values>
    <values>
